e flow of history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/42be5470a061bcbdad14cb6caf5d6b3f.poster.avif?t=1769059601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/42be5470a061bcbdad14cb6caf5d6b3f.webm?t=1769059601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/42be5470a061bcbdad14cb6caf5d6b3f.mp4?t=1769059601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoops Are Found in the Field, Not at a Desk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't find the truth just by sitting in the office. Dispatch reporters to the scene to secure decisive evidence. Tail suspects, eavesdrop, and steal documents. But be careful\u2014if caught, your reporter might never return.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Minigames:</strong> Experience the reporting process through Stealth, Tailing, Wiretapping, Stenography, and Interviews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Action:</strong> Avoid the guards' line of sight and crack codes to uncover the truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/f38b1e8558034073f10d71fad4e4d049.poster.avif?t=1769059601\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/f38b1e8558034073f10d71fad4e4d049.webm?t=1769059601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/extras/f38b1e8558034073f10d71fad4e4d049.mp4?t=1769059601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Rests on the Dice, Reporters Rest on You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newspaper doesn't run itself. Hire and train reporters with unique abilities and personalities. But beware: excessive workload and the pressure of the era can drive them to madness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRPG Style Gameplay:</strong> Success depends on reporter stats and the roll of the Dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress Management:</strong> Manage your team's mental health so they don't break down or betray you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Publish Your Own Newspaper:</strong> Strategic editing via article layout and resizing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record of the Era:</strong> Major historical events and timelines from 1920 to 1945 based on real history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management Simulation:</strong> Manage ads, salaries, and pay special taxes to the colonial government.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Endings:</strong> Various endings determined by your choices and political stance (Pro-Japanese/Anti-Japanese).</p></li></ul>","developers":["divingstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/9ec78176ebaae6d9be7e562554a0f18f2e0e02f8/header.jpg?t=1769059601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr