ts/steam/apps/3930370/4666d98821c20ddea1dac7a6c91b715922887db2/ss_4666d98821c20ddea1dac7a6c91b715922887db2.600x338.jpg?t=1769059601"}],"short_description":"In 1920s Gyeongseong, the pen is mightier than the sword, but your hand is trembling. As an editor-in-chief, arrange articles, dodge censorship, and manipulate public opinion. Will you wake the people with the truth or yield to survive? Your editorial choices will rewrite history.","steam_appid":3930370,"support_info":{"email":"divingstudio0210@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Korean","type":"game","website":null}